   508	          // return text but are NOT the architect/recapper/... execution
   509	          // result. Writing their text to plan.md would advance the workflow
   510	          // on agent-listing output (the `subagent list` result is plain
   511	          // text). Execution calls set `agent`/`chain`/`tasks`; management
   512	          // calls set `action`. Only fall back for execution calls.
